  "limits": [
    "Exact native Missile/ReturnMissile effect aliases are joined to base-skin resource declarations. The native script body and callback chronology are not supplied by these records.",
    "All selected spell fields remain verbatim, including movement, targeting, damage and client metadata. This reader generates no gameplay rules.",
    "The ordinary missile omits visibilityComponent and has an empty start-bone string. The return declares EnterFOWVisibility and root. Missing and empty fields receive no invented defaults.",
    "Native movement/visibility flags do not establish renderer fog policy, height transforms, trail frames, material arithmetic, particle stop dispatch or pixels.",
    "Private transports and future local outgoing/return phase adapters keep separate verification scope."
  ]
